    "title": "Where to watch the Detroit Pistons vs. Atlanta Hawks for free tonight",
    "text": "Updated: Mar. 25, 2026, 5:01 p.m.Published: Mar. 25, 2026, 5:00 p.m.Detroit Pistons forward Duncan Robinson, right, passes the ball past Atlanta Hawks forward Mouhamed Gueye, left, during the second half of an NBA basketball game Friday, Dec. 12, 2025, in Detroit. (AP Photo/Duane Burleson) APAPIf you purchase a product through a link on our site, we may receive compensation.By Jenna Malinowski | JMalinowski@mlive.comThe Detroit Pistons will look to extend their winning streak tonight when they host the Atlanta Hawks. Fans can catch the game on ESPN at 7 p.m. ET, with streaming options available through Fubo, DirecTV Stream, Sling and ESPN+. Free trials and first-month discounts are available for new customers through Fubo and DirecTV Stream. Streaming OptionsTable not scrollableThe Pistons have secured a playoff spot and remain at the top of the Eastern Conference with a 52-19 record. They’re in the midst of a four-game winning streak after defeating the Los Angeles Lakers, 113-110, on Monday night. Daniss Jenkins led the team with 30 points and eight assists in the win. The Hawks are in sixth place in the Eastern Conference with a 40-32 record. They’re looking to build on the momentum from their 146-107 victory over the Memphis Grizzlies on Monday. Nickeil Alexander-Walker had a team-high 26 points. NBADetroit Pistons (52-19) vs. Atlanta Hawks (40-32)When: Wednesday, March 25, 2026Where: Little Caesars Arena, Detroit, Mich. Time: 7 p.m. ETChannel: ESPNWhere to watch Auburn vs. Illinois State NIT semifinal matchup for free tonightWhere to watch New Mexico vs. Tulsa NIT semifinal matchup for free tonightWhere to watch Illinois vs. UConn Final Four matchup for free this weekendJenna is a sports commerce writer for MLive.com. She writes about how to stream and get ticket deals for your favorite sporting events and where you can find gear for the Detroit Tigers, the Detroit Red Wings,...TOP STREAMING PICKSBY MLIVE.COM",
